Remove all occurrences of a character in a string

Difficulty: EasyAccuracy: 70.0%Submissions: 50+Points: 2Average Time: 10m

Given a string s and a character c. The task is to remove all the occurrences of the character in the string.

Problem link :https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/remove-all-occurrences-of-a-character-in-a-string/1?page=1&difficulty=Basic,Easy&status=solved&sortBy=submissions
*/

class Solution {
    // Function to remove all occurrences of the character from the string
    public void removeCharacter(StringBuilder s, char c) {
        // code here
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) 
        {
            if (s.charAt(i) == c) 
            {
                s.deleteCharAt(i); // Removes the character at the current index
               // i--; // Decrease the index to check the next character after deletion
            }
        }
    }
}

